# Robot Game

This project is a browser-based version of the robot collector game, rebuilt without Godot.

Features:
- 3D robot movement and camera
- robot selection and color customization
- weapon switching
- enemies and combat
- scrap pickup and upgrades
- local progress saving in the browser
- mobile-friendly touch controls

## Run it locally

Use a static web server in the project directory:

npm install
npm start

Then open:

http://localhost:8000

## Controls

Desktop:
- W/A/S/D: move
- Mouse: look around
- Left click: fire
- Right click: melee
- Shift: sprint
- 1 / 2: switch weapon
- Space: jump

Mobile:
- joystick on the left
- Fire and Melee buttons on the right

## Notes

This is a separate, non-Godot project intended to keep the original Godot repository untouched.
